# Freestrider Commando: "if it wasn't cast" (CR 614.1c): Show and Tell puts it onto the battlefield from the hand without casting it, so it enters
# with two +1/+1 counters, a 5/5, though Bot1 spent {2}{U} on Show and Tell itself. Bot2's hand of Lightning Bolts has nothing to put.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Freestrider Commando
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt x7
Lightning Bolt x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Freestrider Commando)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Freestrider Commando.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Freestrider Commando.Power = 5

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Freestrider Commando.Toughness = 5
